 ## Tone and compliance notes
-- Medical advertising: no guarantees, use phrases like "clinical averages", "results vary", "your surgeon will advise", "many patients experience"
-- AHPRA/TGA: no testimonials, no before/after claims, no guaranteed outcomes; weight loss percentages (e.g. 60–70% excess weight) must be framed as "many patients" or "clinical averages", never as guaranteed individual results
+- Medical advertising: no guarantees; use individually-assessed wording such as "results vary" and "your surgeon will advise"; keep quantified outcome claims out of paste-ready copy
